#. module: iot
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/iot/static/src/network_utils/iot_http_service.js:0
msgid ""
"Blackbox did not respond to your request. This usually means it has "
"disconnected. Please check its cable connection and its power supply. "
"Restart if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Blackbox ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງທ່ານ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວໝາຍເຖິງມີການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບສ"
"າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງຈ່າຍໄຟ. ຫາກຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່."

#. module: iot
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/iot/static/src/network_utils/iot_http_service.js:0
msgid ""
"Blackbox driver update required. Please restart your IoT Box to update the "
"blackbox driver."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການອັບເດດໄດຣເວີ Blackbox. ກະລຸນາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອງ IoT ໃໝ່ເພື່ອອັບເດດໄດຣເວີ Blackbox."

#. module: iot
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/iot/static/src/network_utils/iot_http_service.js:0
msgid "Blackbox is running and operational"
msgstr "Blackbox ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ"

#. module: iot
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/iot/static/src/network_utils/iot_http_service.js:0
msgid ""
"Blackbox responded with invalid response. Please check the cable connection "
"and the power supply, then retry. Restart if necessary"
msgstr ""
"Blackbox ຕອບສະໜອງກັບມາດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບສາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງຈ່າຍໄຟ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີ"
"ກຄັ້ງ. ຫາກຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່"

